# Sibling statements meeting at one map whose members stay unsettled
# through a pass: the spread's key() settles only on a later pass. Each
# statement is one term of the fold at `a`, and the fold meets every
# member already there again, so a member is met once per term. This
# document is legal and must unify in both engines.
